# Hexiri 2.0 Phase 1 base packages, EndeavourOS no-DE
# Minimal only. No apps, no GUI preinstalls, no Limine, no snap/btrfs.
# EndeavourOS already ships: pacman, yay, PipeWire, NetworkManager, bluez,
# power-profiles-daemon, upower, fonts, FirewallD, dracut, systemd-boot.
# Do NOT add: mkinitcpio, limine, snapper, linux-omarchy, Waybar, Mako,
# Walker, hyprlock, hypridle, swaybg, hyprpolkitagent.
#
# Compositor and session
hyprland
uwsm
sddm
xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland
xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
xdg-user-dirs
xdg-utils
xorg-xwayland
#
# Quickshell, Arch extra, NOT quickshell-git by default
quickshell
qt6-base
qt6-declarative
qt6-wayland
qt6-svg
qt6-5compat
qt6-multimedia
qt6-imageformats
#
# Polkit and auth, QS polkit owns it once proven
polkit
rtkit
gnome-keyring
libsecret
#
# Helpers
pamixer
brightnessctl
jq
bc
curl
wget
git
base-devel
imagemagick
inotify-tools
grim
slurp
wl-clipboard
hyprpicker
hyprsunset
ffmpeg
unzip
ripgrep
fd
fzf
eza
bat
starship
zoxide
fastfetch
python
python-gobject
lua51
luarocks
#
# Terminal and fonts
kitty
udiskie
noto-fonts
noto-fonts-cjk
noto-fonts-emoji
ttf-jetbrains-mono-nerd
woff2-font-awesome
terminus-font
# NOTE 2026-11-23: noto-fonts-cjk-vf and ttf-jetbrains-mono-nerd-basic are
# Omarchy-repo-only names, NOT Arch. Arch extra: noto-fonts-cjk, ttf-jetbrains-mono-nerd.
#
# GPU, installer branches by PCI vendor, do NOT install all of these
# AMD: mesa vulkan-radeon lib32-mesa lib32-vulkan-radeon amd-ucode linux-firmware
# Nvidia Turing+: nvidia-open-dkms nvidia-utils lib32-nvidia-utils nvidia-settings egl-wayland
# Nvidia Pascal GTX 1080 Ti, AUR only: nvidia-580xx-dkms nvidia-580xx-utils, plus linux-headers
# Intel fallback: mesa vulkan-intel lib32-mesa lib32-vulkan-intel
#
# Arch substitutes for Omarchy-repo-only apps (2026-11-23, v2/install.sh
# patch step). Do NOT install the Omarchy-repo-only ones, they have no
# Arch or AUR package: omasnap -> grim + slurp (above), omacalc ->
# gnome-calculator, omaview -> imv. cliamp, omawrite and Obsidian binds
# are REMOVED, not substituted: Devi 2026-11-23 does not want ncspot,
# ghostwriter or obsidian, so there is no substitute to install. Herdr
# bind removed (AI agent, out of v2 scope).
# Spotify is AUR, not pacman: yay -S spotify (fallback: pacman
# spotify-launcher, plus a spotify wrapper in /usr/share/hexciri/bin/).
# spicetify-cli is AUR too: yay -S spicetify-cli.
gnome-calculator
tesseract
